message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Catkin Biofilm Adsorption: kinetic and isotherm analysis of reactive dye adsorption on a Saccharum spontaneum (catkin) CMC/PVA/TiO2 biofilm"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, data and outputs for a study of Avitera Light Red SE
  adsorption on a citric-acid crosslinked PVA/TiO2/cellulose-microcrystal
  biofilm made with cellulose microcrystals from Saccharum spontaneum
  (catkin) flower fibre. Includes dataset validation, nonlinear
  least-squares fits of eleven kinetic and three isotherm laws with AICc,
  leave-one-out error, profile-likelihood intervals and a calibration
  sensitivity analysis, and a pre-specified simulation of how sampling
  density and placement affect recovery of the kinetic law.
type: software
